t);\n        Edge backward = new Edge(from, g.get(from).size(), 0, -cost);\n        g.get(from).add(forward);\n        g.get(to).add(backward);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int N = sc.nextInt();\n        int m = sc.nextInt();\n        int k = sc.nextInt();\n        int c = sc.nextInt();\n        int d = sc.nextInt();\n\n        int timesteps = 101;\n        int n = N * timesteps + 2;\n        List<List<Edge>> g = new ArrayList<>(n);\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            g.add(new ArrayList<>());\n        }\n\n        int source = n - 2;\n        int sink = n - 1;\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            int x = sc.nextInt();\n            x--;\n            addEdge(g, source, x * timesteps, 1, 0);\n        }\n\n        for (int j = 0; j < timesteps; j++) {\n            addEdge(g, j, sink, Integer.MAX_VALUE / 2, j * c);\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 1; i < N; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j + 1 < timesteps; j++) {\n                addEdge(g, i * timesteps + j, i * timesteps + j + 1, Integer.MAX_VALUE / 2, 0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            int u = sc.nextInt();\n            int v = sc.nextInt();\n            u--;\n            v--;\n            for (int j = 0; j + 1 < timesteps; j++) {\n                for (int K = 1; K <= k; K++) {\n                    int costVal = d * (K * K - (K - 1) * (K - 1));\n                    addEdge(g, u * timesteps + j, v * timesteps + j + 1, 1, costVal);\n                    addEdge(g, v * timesteps + j, u * timesteps + j + 1, 1, costVal);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        int flow = 0, cost = 0;\n        int INF = Integer.MAX_VALUE / 2;\n\n        while (flow < k) {\n            int[] dist = new int[n];\n            int[] prevv = new int[n];\n            int[] preve = new int[n];\n            int[] id = new int[n];\n            int[] q = new int[n];\n            Arrays.fill(dist, INF);\n            dist[source] = 0;\n            int qh = 0, qt = 0;\n            q[qt++] = source;\n            id[source] = 1;\n\n            while (qh != qt) {\n                int v = q[qh++];\n                if (qh == n) qh = 0;\n                id[v] = 2;\n                for (int i = 0; i < g.get(v).size(); i++) {\n                    Edge e = g.get(v).get(i);\n                    if (e.cap > 0 && dist[v] + e.cost < dist[e.to]) {\n                        dist[e.to] = dist[v] + e.cost;\n                        prevv[e.to] = v;\n                        preve[e.to] = i;\n                        if (id[e.to] == 0) {\n                            q[qt++] = e.to;\n                            if (qt == n) qt = 0;\n                        } else if (id[e.to] == 2) {\n                            if (--qh == -1) qh = n - 1;\n                            q[qh] = e.to;\n                        }\n                        id[e.to] = 1;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            if (dist[sink] == INF) break;\n\n            int addFlow = k - flow;\n            for (int v = sink; v != source; v = prevv[v]) {\n                int pv = prevv[v];\n                int pr = preve[v];\n                addFlow = Math.min(addFlow, g.get(pv).get(pr).cap);\n            }\n\n            for (int v = sink; v != source; v = prevv[v]) {\n                int pv = prevv[v];\n                int pr = preve[v];\n                int rev = g.get(pv).get(pr).rev;\n                g.get(pv).get(pr).cap -= addFlow;\n                g.get(v).get(rev).cap += addFlow;\n                cost += g.get(pv).get(pr).cost * addFlow;\n            }\n\n            flow += addFlow;\n        }\n\n        // assert flow == k;\n        System.out.println(cost);\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.0251946150674485e-05, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00015186110977083445, -0.00010656742